  clueId: ff_nightbook
  displayTitle: The Last Page
  bodyText: Nobody leaves this building unsigned. That is not a rule he made up -
    it is the only thing he has ever done. The book takes one name a night and it
    has never taken two. Whoever you write down is the one it lets go. Decide before
    you pick up the pen.
